## Compliance Officer

BPS (Banca Popolare di Sondrio) SUISSE — open position in Lugano (TI).

Banca Popolare di Sondrio (Suisse) SA – Human Resources Office Via Maggio 1, 6900 Lugano - Tel. 058 855 31 00, resourcesumane@bps-suisse.ch, www.bps-suisse.ch Works with us We are a Swiss banking institution that has a strong territorial presence at national level and to strengthen our team at the Registered Office in Lugano we look for a reasoned Compliance Officer (100%) We are a dynamic and hungry team where communication, professionalism and customer orientation are key values. We are looking for a Collega who wants to take the opportunity to become part of a growing company, to contribute to its development and to be able to become passionate about work, have an excellent predisposition to interpersonal relationships and an irrepressible conduct. Shipments
• Support for compliance, such as the Institute, for all banking compliance;
• Evasion of compliance practices including: onboarding of new customers, periodic review of customer KYC profiles, predisposition of documentation for internal, external auditors and Authority;
• Plausibility controls in the area of traffic monitoring payments, transactions and higher risk relationships (KYT);
• Use of the goAML platform, setup and management of signals to be forwarded to MROS;
• To help set up and update internal regulations and procedures;
• Collaborate in the planning and delivery of personnel training in the fields of compliance, in particular anti-money laundering, sanctions, CDB, cross-border, suitability, etc.;
• Participate in further internal control and consulting activities of compliance service. Profile
• University license in economics, law or equivalent;
• Higher specialized training in compliance (CAS, DAS, Executive Master or similar);
• At least 3 years of experience in banking compliance or financial intermediaries subject to supervision and solid knowledge of the Swiss regulatory framework;
• Motivated, reliable and precise person;
• Excellent analytical and organizational capacity;
• Mastery of Italian with good knowledge of French, German and English written and oral;
• Good computer knowledge and environment Microsoft365. Perspectives
• Interesting activity, diversified and characterized by an appropriate degree of autonomy;
• Working environment in a young and hungry team;
• Opportunities to contribute to the development of the Compliance and the Institute;
• Social benefits above the average;
• Place of work: Lugano. We will only respond to research-compliant applications without any commitment from the Bank. If you are interested in submitting your application, complete with Curriculum Vitae and certificates to: resourceumane@bps-suisse.ch Human Resources Office Banca Popolare di Sondrio (SUISSE), Via Maggio 1, 6900 Lugano www.bps-suisse.ch We guarantee maximum professionalism and discretion.

Sector:* Banking/Financial

Sede: Via Giacomo Bentina 5, 6901 Lugano, TI, Switzerland

[Official note (PDF)](https://www.bps-suisse.ch/pdf/announce compliance officer 1 en.pdf)

